{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1789900739044753049,"compiled_state":{"alias":"explorable-catty-muskrat","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"a61f5d10bde21c5f930feeae1cf5d8aa28283eaa5dc055daefb93da3aee28302","event_uuid":"bf3d8079-2683-4dac-8567-4dd8a1ccdbf3","position":{"commit_sha":"d3d8288b917aa54e9f0848b26ff30e615f9f7a62","position":"1789894134105522965-bf3d8079-2683-4dac-8567-4dd8a1ccdbf3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"77b7fa94c38a930678ae529b753940675d704d1d3ddf08d370fc352641698fe8","event_uuid":"03eeadc4-6531-4313-aecb-d9cd04a6f2c8","position":{"commit_sha":"98c1c0e89486ac44246f872d9d61153243c3e108","position":"1789894143829793525-03eeadc4-6531-4313-aecb-d9cd04a6f2c8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1789894134105522965,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"03eeadc4-6531-4313-aecb-d9cd04a6f2c8","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"46b2-fb3b-e9d4-4b9d"}],"description":"## Problem\n\nThe CloudWatch alarm `lmn-staging-private-context-denied` fires on expected\ntraffic, so it carries no signal.\n\nIt watches raw `AWS/S3 4xxErrors` with\n`BucketName=lmn-staging-private-context-896586841071`,\n`FilterId=all-private-context-requests`, threshold `Sum > 5` over 300 seconds.\nThat filter counts every 4xx against the bucket, including the deliberate\nnegative-access probes the `lmn-staging-private-audit-*` runner issues to prove\nthe private-context isolation is enforced.\n\nInvestigation on `46b2-fb3b` found 96 `403 AccessDenied` records in a single\naudit window, every one of them from a `lmn-staging-private-audit-*` session, and\nconfirmed the bucket policy was behaving correctly. The alarm is mis-scoped, not\nthe access control.\n\n## Design\n\nReplace the raw `4xxErrors` alarm with a metric that counts only unexpected\ndenials, sourced from the S3 server access logs:\n\n```\nbucket      = lmn-staging-private-context-896586841071\nhttp_status = 403\nerror_code  = AccessDenied\nrequester NOT LIKE arn:aws:sts::896586841071:assumed-role/*/lmn-staging-private-audit-*\nrequester  != arn:aws:iam::896586841071:user/joe_frontier\nthreshold: Sum > 5 over 300 seconds\n```\n\nDo NOT add the audited application roles to the bucket-policy allowlist. That\nwould silence the alarm by removing the isolation the audit exists to verify.\n\nInterim option while the metric is built: pace the audit runner to at most 5\n`AccessDenied` responses per 300 seconds, or run it under explicit alarm\nsuppression for the duration of the audit.\n\nNote for whoever picks this up: the account has no CloudTrail trails and no event\ndata stores, so S3 data-event denials are visible only through the server access\nlogs at `lmn-staging-private-context-logs-896586841071/access/`. Adding a\ndata-event trail is a possible alternative source.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] The alarm no longer fires on a `lmn-staging-private-audit-*` run that produces only expected denials.\n- [ ] The alarm still fires when a principal outside the audit runner is denied more than 5 times in 300 seconds.\n- [ ] The bucket policy retains its curator-and-generator data-access restriction unchanged.\n- [ ] The bucket policy retains its approved-principal inventory-inspection restriction unchanged.\n- [ ] The audited application roles are absent from the bucket-policy allowlist.\n- [ ] The metric source for the new alarm is documented on this ticket.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["aws","monitoring","lmn-staging","external-infra"],"ticket_id":"794e-7479-5f21-49db","ticket_type":"bug","title":"lmn-staging private-context denied alarm counts expected audit probes, so it has no signal","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bf3d8079-2683-4dac-8567-4dd8a1ccdbf3","03eeadc4-6531-4313-aecb-d9cd04a6f2c8"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1789900739044753049,"uuid":"6ef92329-fd5d-40b7-857d-73e83d1d99fb"}